															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609146204" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;" >MrWrong</a></span> <span class="odate time_1435113440 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">24 Jun 2015 02:37</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2323673">
									

<p>Allow me to extend my thanks to various people: wheatmiser, TyGently, Dr_Leonard, AndarielHalo among others.</p>
<p>This article references the following articles:</p>
<ul>
<li>SCP-1132-J (Head-Cannons) by Aelanna</li>
<li>SCP-2615-J (Clap Your Hands) by DreamwalkerFae</li>
<li>SCP-damej-J (damej robit) by Faminepulse, djkaktus, and Decibelles</li>
</ul>
<p>And what is the damned thing anyway&#8230;</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;show&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">–&nbsp;hide&nbsp;block</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>All the iterations share a common theme: &quot;headcanon&quot;. SCP-2159 is the incarnation of headcanon, so everyone perceives it as headcanon.</p>
<p>Isaac Netero fights via something called the Type-100 Guan Yin Bodhisattva, while <em>Graduation</em> is based on Canon in D.</p>
<p>However, over time, these headcanons become superseded by Word of God that incorporates the opinion of the so-called &quot;fanbase&quot; into the finalised canon.</p>
<p>Iteration 0 is technically a <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/?title=Vajra">vajra</a>, a ritualistic item that represents both lightning and diamond. That is the explanation for some of the traits surrounding SCP-2159 (density, fulgurite etc.). It literally fell to the Earth, that's for sure.</p>
<p>As for the unexplained context&#8230; let's just say that a (trickster?) deity wants to make a point about perception.</p>
<p>And Halo, I'm sorry. I will admit that something sentient and with souls can be affected. However, I find hard to believe that AI technology would be <em>that</em> advanced by 2004 and camera-based tsukumogami are impossible since tsukumogami don't go well with electricity (or electrical appliances, in general).</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

