<p>&#8230;and camera-based tsukumogami are impossible since tsukumogami don't go well with electricity (or electrical appliances, in general).</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Actually, I've had some experience with tsukumogami. Turns out the whole &quot;tsukumogami spirits are repelled by electricity&quot; aspect of the lore is a complete load of crap (as is every variant of the &quot;magic &amp; science don't get along&quot; cliche that I've had any level of first-hand experience with). It's just that by the time an electronic device meets all the criteria for conversion into a tsukumogami creature, it tends to be in too deplorable of a condition for the conversion process to work (for lack of a better way of putting it).</p>

